~ day_start
Mum: One day down, two to go! Honey, how are you holding up?
Kid: Just fine, Mom! I think I figured out how to knock leaves off the window! My raindrops have a better chance of winning, now.
Mum: That's...great. Just don't hurt yourself!


do game.begin_game()

=> END


~ day_end
Mum: The sun is out on Day 2!
Kid: Are we there yet?
Mum: Not even close.

do game.end_day()

=> END